  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald", "title": "Reason, Act, Observe",
      "items": [
        "The agent loop sends the whole history to the brain on every iteration",
        "tool_use blocks go to execute_tool(); all results return in one user message",
        "The loop stops on a final answer, a refusal, or max_iterations"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan", "title": "Shell vs core",
      "items": [
        "Only brain/llm.py imports anthropic; the model is one constant",
        "Tools never raise into the loop: failures become 'Error: ...' strings marked is_error",
        "Adding a tool = one module with a function + SCHEMA, one line in the registry"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber", "title": "Chat memory",
      "items": [
        "The chat keeps one history list across turns; /reset clears it",
        "A turn that fails or is interrupted is removed so history stays valid",
        "Settings come from get_config(), validated once at startup"
      ]
    }
  ]
